  "notes": "Transitions are illustrative UX handoff scenarios, not a complete state reducer. All authoritative state changes require current-session freshness checks; verified_state has no legitimate event producer in existing scaffolds. A retry after engine failure is non-protected and must not assert confirmed tunnel teardown; only a trusted service stop acknowledgement after a disconnecting phase may establish disconnected."
